# @last-edited: 2026-11-04 UTC+7.
# @title: _headers — the CSP and cache policy every path of the site answers with.
# @state: the single source of hosting policy; tests/landing-hosting.test.mjs fails on drift.
# @dependencies: none.

# WHY this file exists: Cloudflare Pages is the only host, and it configures headers with this file.
# One path per block: a comma-joined path line matches nothing on Cloudflare, so every rule silently went unapplied and the edge served its defaults instead of this policy.
# Measured live: no CSP and the wrong referrer policy on every page until this shape.
# tests/landing-hosting.test.mjs fails on any drift.

